WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.680
Before we dive into the proof, here is the exact formula we are going to build.

00:05.300 --> 00:08.620
At first glance, nested square roots might look intimidating,

00:09.020 --> 00:14.180
but every single piece inside this expression comes directly from Pythagoras' theorem

00:14.180 --> 00:16.660
applied to three right-angled triangles.

00:17.460 --> 00:21.640
Let's freeze the parking maneuver at its most critical instant and see why.

